('482', 'bangladesh-treaties', 'bangladesh-treaties-reference', 'কতিপয় গুরুত্বপূর্ণ চুক্তি', 'HANA- Humanitarain Assistance Needs Assessment.', 'medium', 'f426bf7be90f621d9bf393b9afe3f5b37217fa7f08895035eb673add9e89dc94', 'source_attributed'),
